Problem
Create Azure VM nautilus-vm with Nginx installed via custom script extension.

Solution
Portal Steps:

Create VM nautilus-vm:

Image: Ubuntu 22.04 LTS

Allow SSH (22) and HTTP (80)

Add Custom Script Extension (Advanced tab):

bash
#!/bin/bash
apt-get update -y
apt-get install nginx -y
systemctl start nginx
systemctl enable nginx
Verify NSG allows HTTP port 80

Test:

bash
curl http://<PUBLIC_IP>
Manual fix if script fails:

bash
ssh -i ~/.ssh/azure_vm_key azureuser@<PUBLIC_IP>
sudo apt-get update -y
sudo apt-get install nginx -y
sudo systemctl start nginx
sudo systemctl enable nginx
